 to lift it up by the  edges except place it on the pot takes a  serrated preferably a serrated knife  give it one long score and then take the  pot quickly put it on top of the  preheated pan places in the oven at 500  degrees for a half an hour  that's Oh half now we're going to remove  the parchment paper and then allow it to  continue baking for another ten minutes  so here we have our big whole-wheat  sourdough bread with bake for about 40  minutes so this is about a 1 pound loaf  of bread  more or less I hope you get a chance to  make it yourself at home  wocka wocka wocka wocka wocka wocka  wocka welcome  [Music]

